WEBVTT

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:05.270
What is this?

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.930
Now you pay the price for trying to 
chain a god and force it to obey...

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.590
This isn't your doing?

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:19.590
It seems the prayers of the Kazanari, 
our desire to protect the country,

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:22.510
have all ended here...

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.330
Is that...

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:37.130
Impudent.

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:40.210
How dare mere tools try to 
make me their slave?

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:43.180
Tools? Is she talking about us?

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:44.320
How frustrating.

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:48.950
It's impossible to share everything 
with the incomplete language of tools.

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:50.470
What do you mean?

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:53.220
I mean that understanding is impossible now.

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:59.230
Oh... that was the terrible 
curse of Balal, wasn't it?

00:01:03.590 --> 00:01:11.040
<i>Seilien coffin Airgetlám tron.</i>

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:15.560
Leave it to me!

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:17.860
Commander, get the suspect 
and her father out of here.

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:19.260
Maria!

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:21.270
Tsubasa, we're leaving!

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:32.020
<i>I just need to protect the places close to me</i>

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:36.700
<i>It's all I can do</i>

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:37.410
Absurd.

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:39.860
<i>It's because I am so weak</i>

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:41.860
Your paradoxical desire not to hurt
 this body dulls your blade.

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:48.100
<i>That I was happy just to grab 
the happiness I could see</i>

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:47.280
Unworthy of my time. 
Come with all your power.

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:51.500
<i>But the wind called time...</i>

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:55.420
Silver light?

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:57.020
Matter transmutation?

00:01:57.020 --> 00:01:59.050
She's rewriting their molecular structure?

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:01.290
Impossible physics...

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:04.810
In a brute-force way
 completely unlike alchemy...

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:10.670
<i>As long as I have a sky to howl "damn!" to</i>

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:12.570
Frustrating. This is all I can do with 
my current level of integration...

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:13.900
<i>No matter what enemy tramples me down</i>

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:16.820
Or perhaps I used too much power 
activating the Yggdrasil.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.550
<i>Even if my arm breaks</i>

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:21.710
<i>Then I'll punch them with the broken arm</i>

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:24.070
Maria-san has captured Shem-ha.

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:25.690
<i>It's okay if I lose to the enemy</i>

00:02:24.070 --> 00:02:25.710
If we can keep her from moving...

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:32.190
<i>Not losing to myself is my fire</i>

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:28.490
That left arm.

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:34.840
Shocking. You're wearing
 something interesting.

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:37.200
Are you one of the
 descendants of Enki?

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:39.640
Yggdrasil? Enki?

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:41.920
I don't understand a thing you're saying!

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:47.060
I'll just have to...

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:00.540
Noble Red?

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:04.450
But this power... They're far 
stronger than before!

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:11.750
Those guys...

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:14.600
The commander's group
 has left the battlefield!

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:17.970
We're done here! Maria-san, please withdraw!

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:20.660
Yeah, I think I will!

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:28.660
So slow. She thinks she's getting away.

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:30.240
We're not chasing her?

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:32.350
Impossible to understand.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:37.170
With the Yggdrasil system 
towering over the world,

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:40.230
humanity has nowhere to run.

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:35.430
<b>Episode 10
Not a Crude Color of Rust</b>

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:42.910
You dishonor your father, son.

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:46.110
The power of the gods is 
what will unite the weak.

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:50.040
Saving the world with songs is just a dream.

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:56.030
All investigations and 
questioning are complete.

00:05:56.030 --> 00:05:59.630
As of this moment, all restrictions 
on your actions are suspended.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.960
Investigations and questioning? That's it?

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:04.900
What about the punishment for my 
unauthorized use of Amalgam?

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:08.720
We received permission 
just before you used it.

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:12.130
Yatsuhiro had been working 
on it for a while.

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:13.610
My father?

00:06:13.610 --> 00:06:19.570
I'm sorry we couldn't have this done 
in time for my brother's funeral.

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:22.230
It's my own fault for letting 
the enemy control me.

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:28.670
And I was the one who said I couldn't 
bear to go there in handcuffs.

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:31.020
I see.

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:34.440
Tsubasa-san!

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:38.430
Tachibana, I...

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:39.880
I heard everything.

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:43.720
About Miku. About your father.

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:48.600
To be honest, my head's still a mess.

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:53.500
But... the one thing I do know

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:56.980
is that I'm so glad you're back!

00:06:56.980 --> 00:06:58.200
It made me happy.

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:00.330
Tachibana.

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:03.810
I want to start thinking about 
the things I don't understand.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:07.480
So tomorrow, the day after, 
and the days after that...

00:07:07.890 --> 00:07:09.230
Stay with me.

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:13.850
You and I can be together again?

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:15.500
Tsubasa-senpai!

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:16.480
Tsubasa-san!

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:17.460
Tsubasa!

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:21.040
We've all held hands with this dummy.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:24.040
You can't be the only one who doesn't.

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:28.740
Please fight with us.

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:32.170
I...

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:45.870
Welcome home, Tsubasa-san!

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:51.280
Noble Red hasn't been sighted anywhere
 within a two-kilometer radius.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.960
Expand the search radius!

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:55.040
Faster than they can escape!

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:55.990
Roger that.

00:08:15.730 --> 00:08:17.100
What is that?

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:19.780
Fascinating, is it not?

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:25.240
I'm gathering up the fragments of 
myself from the bonds that held me.

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:29.120
I am words, and thus 
I bring everything together.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:33.230
Is this also the power of Shem-ha?

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:39.520
We were killed. I know it.

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:43.670
By a superior being let loose 
in the modern world...

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:55.480
How sad.

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:59.800
My power is less than one ten-thousandth 
of a percent of what it once was.

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:03.290
I won't let you spout bullshit like that!

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:04.320
What?

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:05.720
Millaarc-chan?

00:09:06.030 --> 00:09:08.710
What's going on here?

00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:12.810
This power that fills my body... 
It's like I'm a real...

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:15.570
A real monster?

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:17.440
Yes, that's right.

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:24.450
A drop of my power changed your twisted 
bodies into perfect, complete monsters.

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:27.350
Perfect? Complete?

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:32.080
Does that mean we can't 
go back to being human?

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:33.660
A foolish question.

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:36.040
That's what it means to be complete.

00:09:42.550 --> 00:09:47.990
The terror and loneliness of being 
apart from mankind will never heal.

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:52.370
The monsters will never be human again...

00:09:54.980 --> 00:09:58.130
Such gloom. Serve me, then.

00:09:58.980 --> 00:10:04.460
I will destroy all the loneliness 
and estrangement of this world.

00:10:06.990 --> 00:10:08.130
My goddess...

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:15.450
If you worship her as a goddess, 
Millaarc and I will follow you.

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:23.130
So, Goddess, how are you going to get rid of 
our sense of loneliness and estrangement?

00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:25.660
Simple.

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:29.590
I will return this world to the
 way it was 5,000 years ago.

00:10:29.590 --> 00:10:31.250
5,000 years ago?

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:34.350
That's pre-history!

00:10:34.350 --> 00:10:36.960
What of the thing I asked you for?

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:39.040
Is this it?

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:52.230
Listen well, monsters. 
I will give you your task.

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:59.050
HQ is heading to Tanegashima 
in Kagoshima prefecture.

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:01.020
Tanegashima?

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:05.230
Yes. Our goal is the 
Tanegashima Space Center.

00:11:06.690 --> 00:11:10.650
We found signals coming the lunar 
ruins as if in response to Yggdrasil,

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:17.350
the massive structure that appeared 
near the Kazanari mansion.

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:19.680
Are you telling us...

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:22.310
...to investigate the lunar ruins?

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:25.540
That was on the table 
in the early stages.

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:31.300
But a specially created US special 
forces team will be the ones going.

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:35.270
It's true that we can't leave Yggdrasil.

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:40.710
But is it that easy to get your hands 
on a space rocket that's ready to fly?

00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:43.540
<i>It's a final present from Mr. Yatsuhiro.</i>

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:45.190
From my father?

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:49.840
Mr. President, we're grateful 
for your decision and help.

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:55.550
<i>Much of the reason we escaped international 
criticism for our use of reactive weapons</i>

00:11:55.550 --> 00:12:00.560
<i>was due to Mr. Yatsuhiro's attempts 
to strengthen US-Japanese relations.</i>

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:06.280
<i>The lunar rocket was the symbol of his efforts. 
We'll gladly use it for this purpose.</i>

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:11.100
<i>But now we're even.</i>

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:14.580
<i>And from now on, I intend 
to put you in my debt.</i>

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:16.670
<i>Remember that!</i>

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:21.910
Your mission is to protect the rocket 
that's sending a team to the moon.

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:24.510
It's launching in three days.

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:27.420
The enemy is very likely to attack.

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:29.480
Everyone, stay sharp.

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:30.070
Right!

00:12:30.070 --> 00:12:30.670
Yes.

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:42.650
<b>Tanegashima Port</b>

00:12:44.590 --> 00:12:46.740
Checking in. Nothing to report.

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.450
Nothing here, either.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:51.710
Launch in 24 hours...

00:12:51.710 --> 00:12:53.930
We'll continue to patrol.

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:59.300
But you know... this thing's 
huge when you see it up close.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:05.190
This is a secret, but I was actually 
hoping we could go to the moon!

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:06.700
Me, too!

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:11.910
<i>Alca-Noise signal detected!</i>

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:14.810
<i>Wielders, fight them off.</i>

00:13:16.140 --> 00:13:17.930
Kiri-chan, let's go.

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:18.900
Death!

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:26.600
<i>Various Shul Shagana tron.</i>

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:06.840
Kill.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:11.980
Okay!

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:16.410
<i>With a shining blade</i>

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:20.160
<i>Cabbage cut in half</i>

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:18.170
<b>Δ Style Charming Axel Killer</b>

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:25.970
<i>I did extra homework on how to slaughter you</i>

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:32.700
<i>I'll run through the field with 
high output and full strength</i>

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:29.220
<b>β Style Massive Tri-Circle</b>

00:14:32.070 --> 00:14:34.220
Shul Shagana and Igalima 
have engaged the enemy!

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:38.800
<i>I dive in with my all for 
both my dreams and my fights</i>

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:38.800
The Wielders at the other facilities
 have engaged the enemy.

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:41.500
It's going as planned, for now.

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:45.270
<i>Let's sing when our songs overlap</i>

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:43.820
Yeah. It is.

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:49.770
Oh... that was the terrible 
curse of Balal, wasn't it?

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:51.590
<i>we'll rip apart even the tallest 
wall and create the future</i>

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:52.990
If the enemy is concerned 
with the curse of Balal,

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:54.460
<i>Our dreams won't lose</i>

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:55.960
it's possible to predict what 
she'll do and respond accordingly.

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:59.910
<i>Push through it with your
 strong love - ready, go!</i>

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:58.920
Now if we can just protect the facilities...

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:06.340
<i>I may be inexperience and 
incomplete but I won't run away</i>

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:12.230
Shirabe! Are you okay?

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:18.510
I should have known that the 
Symphogears would anticipate our plan.

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:22.300
But... against the power 
of transcendent wisdom...

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:23.640
you're wasting your time.

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:24.990
The way she looks...

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:27.170
She's using multiple weapons at once?

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:32.550
This power that Shem-ha gave us...

00:15:32.550 --> 00:15:37.260
With this, I won't need the tricks, 
or the blood transfusions,

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:40.720
or the Daedalus End to defeat you!

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:48.270
Damn it! She's so fast!

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:51.680
Vanessa-san, you said you 
wanted to be friends!

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:52.960
Then stop this!

00:15:52.960 --> 00:15:55.370
Yes, I do want to be friends!

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:59.030
But monsters and humans can't be friends!

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:00.640
So....

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:05.650
Now!

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:12.160
We decided to make everybody monsters!

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:13.230
Monsters?!

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:19.320
Noble Red is beating the Wielders badly!

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:23.820
At this rate, the battle area 
will reach the launchpad!

00:16:24.730 --> 00:16:26.310
We can't let them get close!

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:32.670
We won't let you touch the rocket!

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:34.390
We won't let you have your way!

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:38.190
I won't let a research team go to the moon!

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:54.390
Be careful, Kiri-chan.

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:58.650
Right! I'm sure this won't be enough...

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:00.820
She's not here!

00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:04.260
She burrowed through the ground...

00:17:04.260 --> 00:17:05.700
To avoid the attack?

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:09.460
All attachments! V Combine!

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:13.630
Keep going! Dead ahead!

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:16.070
Destroy their only way to the moon!

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:20.340
We are Noble Red.

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:23.440
Not a crude color of rust!

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:36.190
We did it!

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:37.650
They got us!

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:39.560
Well done, Elza-chan.

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:40.620
You're such a good student.

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:45.410
The lunar rocket...!

00:17:49.910 --> 00:17:53.630
We've always, always been 
surrounded by walls,

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:56.170
excluded from the human race.

00:17:56.650 --> 00:17:59.410
Used, betrayed...

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:05.850
But still... we believed that someday we 
could find a way to bury this loneliness...

00:18:10.970 --> 00:18:13.350
If I'm going to end up as a monster...

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:16.070
It would've been better 
if I never knew kindness!

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:26.260
<i>I'm firing off Happy + Go Lucky x Heavy bass!</i>

00:18:26.260 --> 00:18:32.120
<i>The girl who's so cute that
 she wants to eat meat, is here</i>

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:38.500
<i>I'll run through the field with 
high output and full strength</i>

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:36.500
Shirabe!

00:18:38.500 --> 00:18:43.920
<i>I dive in with my all for 
both my dreams and my fights</i>

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:50.710
<i>Let's sing when our songs overlap</i>

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:50.710
<i>When our songs overlap 
for the final fight song</i>

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:55.440
Tsubasa-san!

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:57.700
Thank you, Tachibana!

00:18:57.700 --> 00:19:01.880
The hand you offered me was 
warm, and made me happy!

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:07.780
Shem-ha's plan. Our sorrow...

00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:09.980
They can't be stopped now!

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:21.890
Shirabe-san! Kirika-san!

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:26.550
Those Gears!

00:19:26.550 --> 00:19:28.630
Now, the restrictions are gone...

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:29.990
Amalgam!

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:41.010
Not fair!

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:44.500
<i>(Let's try) Absolute Unchain</i>

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:47.050
<i>Harmonizing, overlapping voices</i>

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:53.160
<i>Become a power we can only create 
together, and turn into courage.</i>

00:19:53.160 --> 00:20:00.050
<i>I won't hesitate anymore. 
I swear my undying love!</i>

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:06.810
<i>Ready go! In the new world 
we opened the way to together</i>

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:13.060
<i>Today there's new friends to 
sing with, to laugh with and cry</i>

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:24.130
<i>No matter what happens, it's okay. Let's 
overcome it and move forward, hand in hand</i>

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:25.380
That is not good news!

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:30.990
<i>The two of us are one, TWIN HEART</i>

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:26.390
Elza-chan!

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:30.830
<b>Polyfilm Scissor Love Dreams</b>

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:46.630
You don't need to turn your heart into a 
monster to rid yourself of loneliness.

00:20:46.630 --> 00:20:50.830
The walls in your heart don't 
exist to reject someone.

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:54.970
They're there to accept 
someone else's feelings...

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:57.120
So don't forget kindness!

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:02.370
Now you've done it!

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:05.460
But don't think is a tie.

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:10.820
We've already achieved our goal of 
stopping you from going to the moon...

00:21:11.100 --> 00:21:12.280
They're doing it again?

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:21.350
If I use that, I can strike 
at your heart, right?!

00:21:21.350 --> 00:21:22.590
Tsubasa!

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:25.800
I'll get Kohinata back,
 if it costs me my life!

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:29.460
Don't let Tsubasa-san go alone!

00:21:29.460 --> 00:21:30.620
Right!

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:35.310
Everyone!

00:21:35.660 --> 00:21:38.250
We can't detect any signals from the Gears!

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:40.080
Increasing scanning area!

00:21:40.080 --> 00:21:41.020
But...

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:44.850
They've disappeared from the world?

00:21:44.850 --> 00:21:46.400
Is that... possible?

00:23:22.200 --> 00:23:23.530
Where am I?

00:23:24.760 --> 00:23:26.300
Chris-chan?

00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:32.650
What kind of joke is this?

00:23:36.320 --> 00:23:38.530
Are we...?
